otg.guide.title=§l§6Guía de la Mochila OTG
otg.guide.body_intro=§bWelcome to the OTG Backpack Manual!§r\n\nUpdated for the current public-stable build: readonly priority helpers, safer Overpack Page 1/Page 2 storage, Stockpile, mobility/combat modules, Offhand Backpack Display setting, Netherite utility stations, Ender Chest deploy, Waystone/addon teleport cleanup, cosmetics, tanks, and multiplayer stability notes.\n\n§7Choose a chapter below.§r
